{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:73f0d7d5e926d446","name":"Outlaw Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-73f0d7d5e926d446","title":"Outlaw Talent Tree","revision":19725,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:29:57Z","sha256":"06a4872a83bdac5c998146d80b12b864219c196864116e9fbc4e6a5c9fe61e9a","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19725","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Outlaw%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-73f0d7d5e926d446","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Outlaw"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Outlaw","referenceId":"reference:2b2740cdf152a7f5"},", you live under a shadow, and everywhere you go, any time you reveal yourself, you risk being noticed and captured. As a result, you develop a number of abilities that help you escape pursuers, even when hopelessly outnumbered.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Confounding Attack"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Tangle Up"]},", ",{"tag":"b","children":["Uncanny Instincts"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Once per encounter, whenever you would use ",{"tag":"b","children":["Uncanny Instincts"]},", you can forgo the movement to make an immediate ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," against the opponent that hit you. If your attack is a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," that hits and deals damage, you and your opponent immediately switch places; assuming both you and your opponent can end in a legal space.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Double Up"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Find an Opening"]},", ",{"tag":"b","children":["Seize the Moment"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Once per encounter, whenever you would use ",{"tag":"b","children":["Seize the Moment"]},", you can forgo the extra ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," to make an immediate ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," against the damaged opponent. If your attack is a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," that hits and deals damage, you treat the damage dealt by you and your ally as though it was one attack for purposes of overcoming ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Reduction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Reduction"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shield Rating"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shield_Rating"},", and determining whether the damage exceeded the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"},". \n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Find an Opening"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Seize the Moment"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you would use ",{"tag":"b","children":["Seize the Moment"]},", you can forgo the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," to be able to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aim","referenceId":"reference:28427fa78a230e42"}," as a single ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," on your turn.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Opportunistic Defense"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Uncanny Instincts"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Once per encounter, whenever you would use ",{"tag":"b","children":["Uncanny Instincts"]},", you can forgo this extra movement and instead increase your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," by 5 until the end of your next turn.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Preternatural Senses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Once per encounter, as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"},", you can add one-half your Class Level to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Defense Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Defense_Score"}," of your choice.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Seize the Moment"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Once per round, whenever an ally successfully damages an opponent, you can take a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Tangle Up"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Uncanny Instincts"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", you can make a non-",{"tag":"a","children":["Area Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Area_Attack"}," melee or ranged attack against an opponent within ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},". If the attack hits, you deal half your normal damage (minimum 1 point), but your opponent loses its next ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move_Action"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Uncanny Instincts"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Once per round whenever an opponent successfully deals damage to you, you can move 1 square as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"},". This movement does not provoke ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attacks of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attacks_of_Opportunity","referenceId":"reference:3f19aef95d530255"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
